From: Duy Truong <duytruong@google.com>
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 16:06:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] Add bracket checking support to SQLiteTokenizer

Add OPTION_CHECK_BRACKETS to SQLiteTokenizer to allow checking for
unbalanced brackets. This can be used to prevent SQL injection where
user-provided selection strings attempt to break out of parentheses.

Bug: 393377017
Test: atest SQLiteTokenizerTest
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX

